{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:6d0a88373d20612e","name":"Creation","source":{"id":"source:reference-6d0a88373d20612e","title":"Creation","revision":19411,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:55:17Z","sha256":"82d14f16fb03291f769ecf9e23d3164a8a1cefa0adc93d56ee50e37b302d7408","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19411","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Creation&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-6d0a88373d20612e","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," requires you to create an object, machine, or other item of great power or significant use. You must use this item in support of another character's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," or in a future ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," of your own. Others might help create the actual item, so long as you lead and make a significant contribution to the effort. Pursuing this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," might require you to seek out rare or restricted materials, expert advice, and adequate construction facilities or shops.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Examples of this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," include Grand Moff Tarkin and the construction of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Death Star"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Death_Star","referenceId":"reference:45339c4ddfce5e9b"},", Raith Sienar and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["TIE Fighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/TIE_Fighter","referenceId":"reference:726e84ae35ac767c"},", and Walex Blissex and the ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Victory I"]},"-Class Star Destroyers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Victory_I-Class_Star_Destroyers"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Destiny Bonus:"]}," For 24 hours, you and any allies within 10 squares of you gain a +1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Checks"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Destiny Penalty:"]}," You take a -2 penalty on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Checks"}," for 24 hours."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Destiny Fulfilled:"]}," You or any ally within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," can spend 2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"}," in a single round while performing an action using the created object."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
